1
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:10,460
Everybody watches and acknowledges
you as the original founder.

2
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,960
Who is this?

3
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,630
Are you the Psycho Helmet?

4
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:18,820
Look at all these applause and
cheering you never had before.

5
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,370
How's that? It feels good, right?

6
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,230
No, not at all.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,860
Let's meet face-to-face and talk.

8
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,340
I'm already by the base
of the broccoli.

9
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:35,270
It's not just broccoli anymore.

10
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:42,630
This thing has absorbed people's will and
turned into something entirely different.

11
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:46,750
Have you ever strongly
believed in something?

12
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:55,230
When strong will gathers, it can turn
something into reality in the world.

13
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:59,070
The world is about to
undergo a huge change.

14
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:03,630
A new God named Psycho Helmet

15
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:06,750
has come into existence
and descended.

16
00:01:08,030 --> 00:01:09,450
God?

17
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:12,380
Aren't you just a manager
for your group?

18
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:19,230
I will put lore where Psycho Helmet
is the reincarnation of the creator god.

19
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:25,770
The one who guides people to the right path
and provide comfort to their heart.

20
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,910
Guide to the right path?

21
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:32,060
Do you really do that?
And comforting their hearts, too?

22
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:35,200
Dunno, I just made it up on the spot.

23
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:41,130
All they have to do is pray to the
Divine Tree 5 minutes a day.

24
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:44,540
That will be nourishment for me.

25
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:52,380
I leave the rest to their own
interpretation that they like.

26
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:59,070
I can see that you want
to complain about it,

27
00:01:59,070 --> 00:02:02,860
but the followers are
having fun doing this.

28
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:05,980
Even Ritsu, even Reigen.

29
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:10,730
Oh, that one is an exception.

30
00:02:10,860 --> 00:02:15,230
He realized pretty quick and tried
to get in the way of the festival.

31
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:19,520
Too bad, the winners are
the ones that had fun.

32
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:23,410
You also made Master Reigen say that.

33
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,080
Didn't you,

34
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:28,120
Dimple?

35
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:34,130
(MOB MOB WOW!)

36
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:37,010
(MOB MOB WOW!)

37
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:39,840
(MOB MOB WOW!)

38
00:02:41,010 --> 00:02:42,680
(MOB MOB WOW!)

39
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,810
I realized that our youth is grey

40
00:02:46,810 --> 00:02:49,730
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

41
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:52,230
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

42
00:02:52,230 --> 00:02:55,400
Struggling through this adolescence

43
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:58,360
Don't disturb my deep psyche

44
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,030
Who is that behind you?

45
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:04,830
Opposing ideas creates distortion

46
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:08,250
Exorcise all the sorrow

47
00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:11,920
So, do what you can now

48
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,830
My life

49
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:17,960
Finally, break it down

50
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:22,300
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

51
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:25,180
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

52
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,930
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

53
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:30,890
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

54
00:03:30,890 --> 00:03:33,400
Taking things as it is

55
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:36,820
In this free relation where
We resent each other

56
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:39,110
Once these two become one

57
00:03:39,110 --> 00:03:41,110
That smile becomes one

58
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:44,200
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

59
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:47,870
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

60
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,290
(MOB MOB WOW!)

61
00:03:49,290 --> 00:03:52,160
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

62
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:53,870
"1"

63
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,040
(MOB MOB WOW!)

64
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:57,340
One and only "1"

65
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,510
(Divine Tree 2 ~Peace~)

66
00:04:04,730 --> 00:04:07,560
Don't be so grumpy.

67
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:09,490
Hanazawa is fine.

68
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:13,940
Anyway, come join the
Psycho Helmet Religion already.

69
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:18,650
We'll make it together
as the two leaders.

70
00:04:18,930 --> 00:04:20,220
Why?

71
00:04:20,220 --> 00:04:24,960
As far as I've seen, you've become
powerful enough on your own.

72
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:28,190
There's still room for growth
for you, Shigeo.

73
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:33,480
Think of your future. It would be
a waste to not use your powers.

74
00:04:33,570 --> 00:04:35,230
I refuse.

75
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:39,940
Yeah, I knew you'd say that.

76
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:45,210
But your family, your friends,
every single person out there,

77
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:48,680
they all put their faith in
Lord Psycho Helmet

78
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:52,760
and are living in a happy world.

79
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:58,770
The only one who hasn't
in this city is just you, Shigeo.

80
00:04:59,110 --> 00:05:02,170
They're not coming back from that.

81
00:05:02,170 --> 00:05:04,860
How much longer
are you going to keep this act?

82
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:08,040
They're only brainwashed by you.

83
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,280
What about you?
When will you stop?

84
00:05:10,380 --> 00:05:12,060
Are you angry?

85
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,500
I'm angry.

86
00:05:13,910 --> 00:05:15,680
Of course I would.

87
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,340
Free them from their
brainwashing right now.

88
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:22,840
How did you even manage to brainwash
Ritsu and Master Reigen?

89
00:05:23,150 --> 00:05:26,760
Phase one is touching the Divine Tree,

90
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:30,120
consuming part of the Divine Tree,
and other ways.

91
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:34,400
Physical contact allows me
to get in their head.

92
00:05:34,590 --> 00:05:40,660
Phase two is by making the weaker-willed
get swallowed up by the herd mentality.

93
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,760
Reigen got caught by that.

94
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:46,980
You could say he's
swallowed up by the mood.

95
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:51,700
And now we're entering phase three.

96
00:05:51,850 --> 00:05:58,160
The passion from the strong belief will
be transmitted to neighboring places.

97
00:05:58,260 --> 00:06:01,720
It's only a matter of time
until the Psycho Helmet faith

98
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,940
spreads through the country.

99
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,760
And then it's going to be amazing.

100
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:10,180
I will really become a new God.

101
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:15,800
I don't really get it, but isn't becoming
a God really pointless?

102
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:18,630
Don't you understand
what you're doing?

103
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,840
Huh?

104
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:22,310
You're causing damage to the city.

105
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,480
Oh, the city?

106
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:26,240
Oops, didn't know about that.

107
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,940
Well, you can just
rebuild that again later.

108
00:06:28,940 --> 00:06:32,100
Enough. Free everyone
from your brainwashing.

109
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:36,410
A one-sided sentimental argument.
That's not like you.

110
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:40,910
Besides, I didn't do anything
as bad as actual brainwashing.

111
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:44,050
I didn't overwrite their personality.

112
00:06:44,050 --> 00:06:47,500
Their hobby, the things they like,
none of it were changed.

113
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,370
Ritsu, Reigen,

114
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:54,240
the Body Improvement Club,
none of their attitude to you changed.

115
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:58,480
It's just that now they're
Psycho Helmet's followers.

116
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,560
And not just that,

117
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:06,480
they would feel happy and share
their joy with one another.

118
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:11,100
Of course, I'm not saying
I'm leaving you out of all of this.

119
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:15,500
So? What are you complaining about?

120
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,510
What's wrong with what I'm doing?

121
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:24,160
What's wrong with that?

122
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:27,170
You're a coward, Dimple.

123
00:07:27,690 --> 00:07:32,400
You're forcibly moving people's hearts
using your power so they can't resist.

124
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:34,420
You're just doing as you please.

125
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:41,380
The world always has laws and societal
structures that make people can't resist.

126
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:45,230
As long as you don't pay them any mind,
there won't be any problem.

127
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:48,480
Besides, if I don't comply to you,

128
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:51,980
you're planning to use force
as a last resort, right?

129
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:54,280
I have no other choice.

130
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:58,040
Because you brainwashed
my family and friends.

131
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:02,870
Even now, I'm actually
holding back quite a lot.

132
00:08:03,370 --> 00:08:05,320
Wait a sec, Kageyama.

133
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:09,500
What Dimple is trying
to do isn't that bad.

134
00:08:09,620 --> 00:08:10,600
Huh?

135
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,270
Calm down for a sec.

136
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:16,440
It's bad if you resort to violence
just because you can't comprehend it.

137
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:19,650
No, I can still make it.

138
00:08:19,650 --> 00:08:23,430
The Psycho Helmet Religion
hasn't fully begun.

139
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,880
No, if you lay a hand,
it'll be over.

140
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:29,820
Your relationship with Dimple, that is.

141
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:32,860
Even our relationship will also end.

142
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:38,450
If you plan to demolish the
Psycho Helmet Religion with brute force,

143
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,490
then I will stop you.

144
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:43,600
Even if you manage to defeat me,

145
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:47,080
your brother and Reigen
won't let it slide.

146
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:51,320
Everyone in the city
will stand to oppose you.

147
00:08:51,530 --> 00:08:54,180
Dimple, you...

148
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:57,630
Hanazawa doesn't wish you any harm.

149
00:08:57,630 --> 00:09:01,470
He's speaking from his heart
to convince you, for your own sake.

150
00:09:01,570 --> 00:09:05,390
I told you, if you leave them be,
their daily life will still...

151
00:09:07,570 --> 00:09:09,760
Come out in your true body, Dimple.

152
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,610
I want to talk face-to-face.

153
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,920
Stop it, Kageyama!

154
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:17,070
We've been talking all this time,
haven't we?

155
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,870
If you're going to hurt
the Psycho Helmet Religion...

156
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:25,370
If you're going to hurt the Divine Tree,
then you must face me!

157
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:41,330
Come to your senses, Hanazawa!

158
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:44,260
Unfortunately, Hanazawa is
already in his right mind.

159
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:46,980
I just have one extra thing
that is important to me now.

160
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:51,110
Until you give it up and go home,
I will fight back!

161
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,320
Sorry.

162
00:10:05,890 --> 00:10:08,340
Dimple, come out!

163
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:20,080
Divinity dwells inside
those who believe.

164
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,890
Right now, there is a God in Hanazawa.

165
00:10:23,900 --> 00:10:27,120
My power is overflowing...

166
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:37,190
Hana...zawa...!

167
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:40,190
Sorry.

168
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:57,400
Oh no, I damaged the Divine Tree again.

169
00:10:57,490 --> 00:10:59,720
Good job, Hanazawa.

170
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:04,060
Shigeo, cool down a bit under
the wrappings of the Divine Tree's roots.

171
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:06,700
You'll change your way of thinking.

172
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,920
That was really strong.

173
00:11:12,290 --> 00:11:14,500
The broccoli roots?

174
00:11:21,590 --> 00:11:23,940
These roots are dangerous.

175
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:27,240
Get out of here, Hanazawa!

176
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:29,270
Huh?

177
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,680
Are you serious now, Kageyama?!

178
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:34,840
Lord Psycho Helmet, get behind me!

179
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,890
A-amazing!

180
00:11:44,890 --> 00:11:47,600
I knew it, you really are amazing!

181
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:59,190
Oh no, you opened an air hole
on the Divine Tree.

182
00:11:59,370 --> 00:12:02,130
Oh well, it'll immediately get closed.

183
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,690
Now that I've become a God,

184
00:12:06,690 --> 00:12:10,950
you can't deal with me
by ordinary means, Shigeo.

185
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,500
It's useless.

186
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:32,590
Dimple, why?

187
00:12:33,450 --> 00:12:36,270
Why won't you show yourself?

188
00:12:46,710 --> 00:12:48,240
Are you...

189
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,500
Are you afraid of me?

190
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:20,290
Are we still doing this?

191
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,660
Enough.

192
00:13:23,810 --> 00:13:25,760
Enough already.

193
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:28,900
Don't make me feel this way.

194
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:32,220
Don't you get it, Dimple?

195
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:35,800
Come out already.

196
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,190
Otherwise...

197
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,480
My power...

198
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:16,000
They're being drained away?

199
00:14:16,810 --> 00:14:18,800
Correct.

200
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:22,900
You realized that a bit too late.

201
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:32,440
You carelessly walked in here when
I asked you to. That was a mistake.

202
00:14:39,090 --> 00:14:42,050
But your biggest mistake...

203
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:47,240
...is opposing me!

204
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:51,340
Dimple, what is the meaning of this?!

205
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:53,930
I told you, calm down.

206
00:14:53,930 --> 00:14:57,870
If I can't convince you,
then maybe that girl can.

207
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:02,200
If Tsubomi tries to convince you,

208
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,910
maybe you'll calm down
for a bit, eh?

209
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:09,950
Mob, you can't cause trouble
for the Psycho Helmet Religion!

210
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:12,300
Get a hint already.

211
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:14,010
How's that?

212
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:21,140
Hey now.

213
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:26,860
You always get so serious
when it comes to Tsubomi.

214
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:30,330
Let me make this clear now.

215
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:34,350
Shigeo, that girl is way
out of your league.

216
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:35,580
What?

217
00:15:38,610 --> 00:15:44,260
Tsubomi Takane is the type of person that
will flatly refuse things she doesn't want.

218
00:15:44,410 --> 00:15:49,340
When I tried to somewhat forcefully
hand the candy, she'd slap them away.

219
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:54,620
Even when persuaded by her friends,
she still doesn't show any interest.

220
00:15:56,380 --> 00:16:00,610
She's a strong woman that lives
following her own values,

221
00:16:00,610 --> 00:16:02,720
never affected by others.

222
00:16:03,070 --> 00:16:07,620
No wonder she's not interested when
you bragged about your psychic powers.

223
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:13,590
Even if you trained your body,
she still won't need you, Shigeo.

224
00:16:14,620 --> 00:16:15,960
However,

225
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:20,200
right now she is a member
of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

226
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:28,000
In other words, she might actually
fall for you if you become the founder.

227
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,970
That is stupid.

228
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:37,970
Here I thought I drained
most of your strength.

229
00:16:38,050 --> 00:16:40,930
Seems like you still have
some left in you.

230
00:16:42,490 --> 00:16:47,140
Maybe it's still too soon for me
to appear in my real body?

231
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,250
Eh, whatever.

232
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:52,610
Right now, I won't lose to even you.

233
00:16:55,710 --> 00:16:57,530
Hey! Hold on!

234
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:07,870
You're getting cocky here,
goddammit!

235
00:17:07,870 --> 00:17:10,600
Don't get arrogant
just because I'm playing nice!

236
00:17:10,810 --> 00:17:15,220
Seems like I have to get serious, too!

237
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,190
Take a good look.

238
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:30,400
Behold, this is the joyous birth of...

239
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:33,420
God Dimple!

240
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,150
So what?

241
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,540
Here I come!

242
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:43,670
God Punch!

243
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:48,800
God Dash!

244
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:52,250
And then!

245
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:55,240
God Slam!

246
00:17:59,250 --> 00:18:02,110
How does a God's power feel?

247
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:03,520
Are you giving up?

248
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:10,360
God Toss!

249
00:18:13,450 --> 00:18:15,960
God...!

250
00:18:16,090 --> 00:18:18,110
Sandbag!

251
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:23,100
God Straight!

252
00:18:29,850 --> 00:18:32,190
I know you, Shigeo.

253
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:37,250
This isn't enough to defeat you.

254
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:42,090
But he should be at his limit soon.

255
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:47,060
I can feel his enormous strength that
has been absorbed through the tree.

256
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:51,420
I saw the limit of his energy
in the battle with the Claw's boss.

257
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:54,700
It's not unlimited.
It will actually run out.

258
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:59,310
He was also losing to
Keiji Mogami's mental attack.

259
00:18:59,470 --> 00:19:01,820
He's not invincible.

260
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:06,890
I know best how to beat
Shigeo Kageyama...

261
00:19:06,890 --> 00:19:10,000
-That is your true form?
-Huh?

262
00:19:11,050 --> 00:19:14,180
Is that supposed to be who you are?

263
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:16,600
You must be joking.

264
00:19:16,820 --> 00:19:20,150
You still have an impudent mouth
even after all that beating.

265
00:19:20,150 --> 00:19:23,690
I'll make you regret
not joining my side!

266
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:27,200
-Is that really what you're thinking?
-What?

267
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:31,070
If that is so, you shouldn't
have pulled your punches.

268
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:34,650
Your power, your actions,

269
00:19:34,650 --> 00:19:36,030
even your words.

270
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:38,300
They're all fakes.

271
00:19:38,670 --> 00:19:42,020
Don't try to fool me into
thinking that's the real you.

272
00:19:42,370 --> 00:19:43,870
This facade of yours...

273
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:47,950
They don't fit you. I won't allow it.
I won't acknowledge it.

274
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:55,350
Who the heck do you think you are?!

275
00:19:55,470 --> 00:19:57,340
You won't acknowledge me?!

276
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:00,340
Don't you so easily deny...

277
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:04,300
...the thing that I've always wished for!

278
00:20:04,940 --> 00:20:08,600
God Beam!

279
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:22,360
Oh no, I put too much energy into it!

280
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,070
Shigeo!

281
00:20:25,470 --> 00:20:28,960
I-I can feel his anger!

282
00:20:32,090 --> 00:20:33,460
H-hang on...

283
00:20:34,270 --> 00:20:39,950
That brat. How come he still
have this much power left?

284
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:46,990
I have to kill him before he kills me!

285
00:20:49,530 --> 00:20:51,940
That surprised me.

286
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:54,540
I thought I was going to die.

287
00:20:54,780 --> 00:20:58,480
A little bit more,
and I would've lost faith in you.

288
00:21:00,610 --> 00:21:04,880
Oh crap, I'm getting scared
just from his glare.

289
00:21:05,020 --> 00:21:07,930
I just want to know
what you're really thinking.

290
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:10,820
Say something, Dimple.

291
00:21:10,930 --> 00:21:13,490
What do you mean,
"What I'm really thinking?"

292
00:21:13,830 --> 00:21:19,460
I've always been using you all along.
It never changed.

293
00:21:19,950 --> 00:21:21,840
I'm sad.

294
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:25,500
Is this where we say our goodbyes?

295
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:26,930
Is he going to attack?!

296
00:21:30,940 --> 00:21:32,440
Full spiritual power!

297
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:35,700
Let's finish this!

298
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:50,540
Your shirt is so lame!

299
00:21:55,532 --> 00:22:00,372
The blue light shined
Dazzling my eye at 01:30 AM

300
00:22:00,412 --> 00:22:05,752
Even as I swiped the page over,
The smiles of friends besides me remain

301
00:22:15,762 --> 00:22:18,182
Yes, I want someone to understand

302
00:22:18,182 --> 00:22:20,682
All the colorless and transparent wishes

303
00:22:20,682 --> 00:22:23,182
All the breath stuck within
The depth of my heart

304
00:22:23,182 --> 00:22:25,812
Suddenly flowed out
Bringing my consciousness back

305
00:22:25,812 --> 00:22:28,272
I remember the days hung dry

306
00:22:28,272 --> 00:22:30,772
The very normal days passed by

307
00:22:30,772 --> 00:22:33,242
Even if reality is corrupted

308
00:22:33,242 --> 00:22:35,992
The sky we saw together
Was definitely real

309
00:22:36,572 --> 00:22:40,702
It's harder to understand than
The grammar on the blackboard

310
00:22:40,702 --> 00:22:45,912
The story that disappears
Under 24 hours makes me sad and lonely

311
00:22:46,182 --> 00:22:50,382
It's so hard, and I find myself
On the verge of giving up again and again

312
00:22:50,382 --> 00:22:51,922
But I...

313
00:22:52,752 --> 00:22:56,092
The current me will no longer give up

314
00:22:56,222 --> 00:23:01,102
Overflowing emotions on my sleeve,
Running through worry and doubt

315
00:23:01,102 --> 00:23:03,730
Nobody has decided
if the future is 0 or 100,

316
00:23:03,732 --> 00:23:06,312
So I'll paint over them myself

317
00:23:06,312 --> 00:23:08,696
Even if my existence itself
can't be proven,

318
00:23:08,698 --> 00:23:11,733
If this world struck me in my heart

319
00:23:11,862 --> 00:23:14,402
I will flood it with cobalt blue

320
00:23:26,340 --> 00:23:29,910
Man, there are so many things
I can't empathize with you, Shigeo.

321
00:23:29,910 --> 00:23:33,050
You could've used your psychic powers
to get more in your life.

322
00:23:33,050 --> 00:23:35,630
Really, you're just so annoying.

323
00:23:35,850 --> 00:23:37,220
Next on episode six of
Mob Psycho 100 III,

324
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:39,900
"Divine Tree 3 ~Dimple is~"
